**3.1.2**

\(\binom{n}{k}\)**=**\(nC_{s}\)**=**\(\frac{n(n-1)\,\ldots\,(n-k+1)}{k!}\)**=**\(\frac{n!}{(n-k)!k!}\)**

**3.1.3**

\(\binom{n}{k}\)**=**\(\binom{n}{n-k}\)**=**\((-1)^{*}\binom{k-n-1}{k}\)**

**3.1.4**

\(\binom{n+1}{k}\)**=**\(\binom{n}{k}\)**+**\(\binom{n}{k-1}\)**

**3.1.5**

\(\binom{n}{0}\)**=**\(\binom{n}{n}\)**=**\(1\)****

